{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Found it</b> — two times in the Masorah: ואם לא מצאה ידו and the other: גם צפור מצאה בית ודרור קן לה. Meaning: if his hand did not find it — that he cannot redeem it — it remains in the buyer's hand until the Jubilee year. This is מצאה בית ודרור: in the Jubilee year he will find his house."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:33.130699918Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}